Claims (20)

What is claimed is:

1. A tool changer for replacing a machining tool held by a working unit with another machining tool to be held by the working unit, the tool changer comprising:

a housing;

a supporting column rotationally coupled to said housing, a portion of said supporting column being configured for linear movement so as to be selectively raised and lowered, said supporting column being rotatable relative to said housing about a first axis;

at least one tool gripper mounted on said supporting column for linear movement with the portion of said supporting column and for rotational movement with the supporting column;

a Maltese wheel rotatably mounted to said housing on a first shaft having a longitudinal rotation axis parallel to said first axis;

cam gear apparatus coupled to said supporting column for raising, lowering, and rotating said at least one tool gripper, said cam gear apparatus comprising:

a drive motor;

